  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen Policies for the Social and Productive Inclusion and Employment of Persons with Disabilities</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento de las Polticas para la Inclusin Social, Productiva y Laboral de Personas con Discapacidad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa de fortalecimiento de las polticas para la inclusion social y productiva de personas con discapacidad busca reducir las barreras fsicas, actitudinales, econmicas, normativas y del entorno que impiden la interaccin de personas con deficiencias fiscas yo intelectuales evitando su participacin plena y efectiva en la sociedad en igualdad de condiciones.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program to strengthen policies for social and productive inclusion of people with disabilities has the objective of reducing physical, attitudinal, economic, normative and environmental barriers that impede the interaction of people with physical or intellectual disabilities preventing their full and effective engagement in society with equal conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
